  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC-Durable Solutions to Displacement in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to enahnce a conducive enviroment for sustainable durable solutions to displacement in South Sudan. Taking three broader thematic areas of governance, accountability and government leadershipship with a focus on Housing, Land and Property (HLP), Rights and Access to Basic Services, and Self-reliance for Sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
